    "what_is_here": "A 33-byte symlink to the graph, which is host-global and shared read-only with concurrent clones. This checkout's own frontend invocation produced NO graph (run-record.md divergence D1), so there is no harness/artifacts/cpg/ directory to publish and none is invented.",
