    "loads_that_read_these_bytes": "all three probe queries of this run. Each re-verified this size and digest against the record of account immediately before loading, copied the graph to a private input under $HARNESS_SCRATCH_DIR, imported only that copy and re-verified it after the load. The identity is published per query in queries/joern/results/<id>.json under graph.identity_record, graph.bytes and graph.sha256."
  },
